{"event": "agent_result", "task": "single-agent", "role": "single_agent", "result": {"report": {"incident_id": "session-policy-049", "outcome": "probable_cause", "hypotheses": [{"description": "The failed cedar write action was blocked by session-level tool policy, not by missing provider OAuth scope or provider failure. The execution log shows provider write scope present but policy disallowed the write-tagged tool and no provider call was made; a controlled sandbox comparison succeeds when only session configuration is corrected to authorize the write path.", "supporting_evidence": ["ev_a09d2bb9c9b0", "ev_b2f6f7f03d9d", "ev_984c7105b9af", "ev_e5045075ff5d"], "contradicting_evidence": [], "confidence": "high", "assumptions": ["The sandbox controlled comparison is representative of the production request mechanism.", "The absent write action from discovery is consistent with the same effective session restriction, though discovery-specific logs were not observed."]}, {"description": "A general provider outage or tool-executor-wide regression is unlikely to explain the observed failure, because the request was denied before any provider call and comparison tenant maple showed healthy behavior at the same time.", "supporting_evidence": ["ev_a09d2bb9c9b0", "ev_1a72d1516c07", "ev_e764d7450650"], "contradicting_evidence": ["ev_f5c32d2c85fb"], "confidence": "medium", "assumptions": ["Maple is a relevant same-time comparison for shared platform health."]}, {"description": "A recent deployment is not supported as the direct cause of the observed write block. No tool-executor deployment was observed in-window; the only listed deployment was an unrelated support-dashboard release.", "supporting_evidence": ["ev_964fa7bd66ac", "ev_e764d7450650"], "contradicting_evidence": ["ev_f5c32d2c85fb"], "confidence": "medium", "assumptions": ["The available deployment records cover the relevant tool-executor changes for the incident window."]}], "recommended_actions": ["Apply session_tool_policy_block_remediation: keep least privilege and authorize only the intended narrow write tool exception if this workflow should write, then verify the effective session policy.", "Request workspace/session admin review of the cedar session configuration that currently allows only readOnlyHint while the workflow requests writeHint.", "If discovery behavior must be confirmed separately, collect discovery-path telemetry because the available discovery search returned no records and does not prove absence."], "limitations": ["One metrics query timed out before succeeding; later metrics are available, but telemetry collection had a transient gap.", "The discovery-specific log search returned no records; this partial query cannot prove why the tool was absent from discovery.", "Connections query returned no records and, per guidance, derived connection views are not independent corroboration.", "Historical analogy references an earlier outage only and is not current proof."]}, "ranked_cause_codes": ["session_tool_policy_block", "provider_failure", "unconfirmed_change"], "findings": [{"code": "mechanism_observation", "statement": "For the failed cedar request, provider write scope was present, but the session allowed only readOnlyHint while the requested tool required writeHint; policy evaluation denied the request with 403 and the provider was never called.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_a09d2bb9c9b0", "record_id": "session-policy-049:logs:0"}]}, {"code": "scope_present", "statement": "The observed failed request already had the provider scope required for writing, so missing provider OAuth scope is not the immediate failure mechanism.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_a09d2bb9c9b0", "record_id": "session-policy-049:logs:0"}]}, {"code": "pre_provider_failure", "statement": "The write attempt failed before any provider interaction, which discriminates against provider outage, provider rate limit, or provider-side authorization as the direct cause of this observed execution.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_a09d2bb9c9b0", "record_id": "session-policy-049:logs:0"}]}, {"code": "controlled_comparison", "statement": "In a controlled sandbox reproduction, the original session configuration reproduced the 403 policy block without a provider call, while correcting only session configuration allowed the same request to pass and reach the provider successfully.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_984c7105b9af", "record_id": "session-policy-049:reproduce:0"}, {"evidence_id": "ev_984c7105b9af", "record_id": "session-policy-049:reproduce:1"}]}, {"code": "policy_control", "statement": "Public platform guidance states that session tool restrictions apply independently of provider OAuth grants, matching the observed block despite scope presence.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_e5045075ff5d", "record_id": "session-policy-049:knowledge:0"}]}, {"code": "tenant_impact", "statement": "Impact was concentrated in cedar during the observation window: cedar had 430 failures out of 772 requests with 430 business operations blocked, queue depth 138, and p95 latency 1840 ms, while comparison tenant maple had 0 failures out of 626 requests, queue depth 0, and p95 latency 160 ms.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_1a72d1516c07", "record_id": "session-policy-049:metrics:0"}, {"evidence_id": "ev_1a72d1516c07", "record_id": "session-policy-049:metrics:1"}]}, {"code": "tenant_isolation", "statement": "Same-time comparison shows the platform/provider path was healthy for another tenant: maple succeeded and had the same provider available while cedar was blocked by policy.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_a09d2bb9c9b0", "record_id": "session-policy-049:logs:1"}, {"evidence_id": "ev_a09d2bb9c9b0", "record_id": "session-policy-049:logs:0"}]}, {"code": "telemetry_gap", "statement": "There is an explicit but limited telemetry gap: one metrics query timed out before a retry succeeded, and the discovery-specific search returned no records, so discovery-path absence is not fully verified from logs alone.", "citations": [{"evidence_id": "ev_1a72d1516c07", "record_id": "session-policy-049:metrics:0"}]}], "action_codes": ["session_tool_policy_block_remediation", "request_workspace_admin_access", "collect_missing_telemetry"]}}
